        "text": "NNS1Gaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa|bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb|L",
        "data": "4e4e5331476161616161616161616161616161616161616161616161617c6262626262626262626262626262626262626262626262627c4c",
        "message": {
