      {
        "id": "G_third_field_that_is_not_L_is_malformed",
        "text": "NNS1Gkikename|a|b",
        "data": "4e4e5331476b696b656e616d657c617c62",
        "result": {
          "ok": false,
          "reason": "MALFORMED_PAYLOAD"
        },
        "note": "Through 2026-09-10 a G split on its first pipe only and `a|b` was a bad ref, recorded as absent. The third field is the lifetime flag now (§6 G): exactly `L` or absent, so anything else in it is a shape error, not accounting — the ref alone can still never reject a paid registration."
      },
